<view class="screen">
  <view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 原发布地区帖子管理</view>
  <view class="title">管理员删除帖子</view>
  <view class="notice">从当前可查看的帖子核验原发布地区管理权限，匿名帖子同样适用。权限和帖子状态以服务端本次核验为准。</view>
  <view class="status" aria-role="status">{{status}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{addressError || error}}" class="error">{{addressError || error}}</view>
  <view wx:if="{{receiptStatus}}" class="notice" aria-role="status">{{receiptStatus}}</view>
  <navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后继续 →</navigator>
  <navigator wx:if="{{ownPost &amp;&amp; target}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{target.id}}">返回帖子使用“删除我的帖子” →</navigator>
  <button bindtap="onReload" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核验目标与原请求</button>
  <button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onStopWaiting">停止等待</button>
  <view wx:if="{{management &amp;&amp; management.canRemove &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">管理此帖子</view>
    <view class="meta">帖子：{{management.target.id}}</view>
    <button bindtap="onRemovePost" disabled="{{busy}}">删除此帖子</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirming === 'remove' &amp;&amp; management &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="card" aria-role="alert">
    <view class="section-title">确认管理员删除此帖子？</view>
    <view class="notice">删除后，此帖子及其评论、回复将不可访问，作者会收到私有系统通知。当前没有恢复此帖的管理入口。未选择处罚时仅删除内容。已下载或正在展示的图片不会即时从所有设备消失。帖子状态变化后需要重新确认。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{management.punishmentOptions}}" class="punishment-controls">
      <view>可选：对该内容的原作者同时处罚</view>
      <view>当前禁言：{{management.punishmentOptions.interaction_mute.current ? (management.punishmentOptions.interaction_mute.current.endsAt || '永久') : '无生效处罚'}}</view>
      <view>当前封号：{{management.punishmentOptions.access_suspension.current ? (management.punishmentOptions.access_suspension.current.endsAt || '永久') : '无生效处罚'}}</view>
      <radio-group bindchange="onPunishmentKind">
        <label><radio value="none" checked="{{punishmentKind === 'none'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>仅删除</label>
        <label><radio value="interaction_mute" checked="{{punishmentKind === 'interaction_mute'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>禁言：可浏览，限制互动</label>
        <label><radio value="access_suspension" checked="{{punishmentKind === 'access_suspension'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>封号：限制大部分浏览和互动</label>
      </radio-group>
      <view wx:if="{{punishmentKind !== 'none'}}">
        <view>处罚只针对该内容的原作者。删除、处罚及两条私有通知一起生效；身份验证状态保持独立。原作者仍可查看处罚原因并申诉。</view>
        <radio-group bindchange="onPunishmentUnit">
          <label><radio value="hours" checked="{{punishmentUnit === 'hours'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>小时</label>
          <label><radio value="days" checked="{{punishmentUnit === 'days'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>天</label>
          <label><radio value="permanent" checked="{{punishmentUnit === 'permanent'}}" disabled="{{busy}}"/>永久</label>
        </radio-group>
        <input wx:if="{{punishmentUnit !== 'permanent'}}" type="number" value="{{punishmentValue}}" bindinput="onPunishmentValue" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="正整数时长"/>
        <textarea value="{{punishmentReason}}" bindinput="onPunishmentReason" disabled="{{busy}}" maxlength="255" placeholder="处罚原因（必填，最多255字）"/>
        <view>有限时长从本次生效时重新计算。同类永久处罚须先由超级管理员解除，不能直接缩短；另一类处罚独立保留。</view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <button bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{busy || frozen}}">确认删除帖子并通知作者</button>
    <button bindtap="onClose" disabled="{{busy}}">返回</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="card">
    <view class="section-title">原管理员删帖请求待确认</view>
    <view wx:if="{{pendingTarget}}" class="meta">帖子 {{pendingTarget.id}} · {{pendingPhase === 'cancel' ? '取消请求' : '提交请求'}}</view>
    <view class="notice">查询不到回执不代表原请求不会完成。确认结果或取消成功前不能创建新请求，请保留本机数据。停止等待不会取消服务器处理。</view>
    <button bindtap="onRecover" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">查询原删帖回执</button>
    <button bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">重试原删帖请求</button>
    <button bindtap="onCancelRequest" disabled="{{busy || !pendingRequestId}}">取消原删帖请求</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{confirming === 'cancel'}}" class="card" aria-role="alert">
    <view>确认取消尚未完成的原删帖请求？如果删除已完成，仍返回原删除结果，不会恢复帖子。</view>
    <button bindtap="onConfirmCancel" disabled="{{busy}}">确认取消原请求</button>
    <button bindtap="onClose" disabled="{{busy}}">返回</button>
  </view>
  <view wx:if="{{!target &amp;&amp; !frozen &amp;&amp; !busy}}" class="notice">没有待确认请求时，请从具体帖子进入管理。</view>
  <navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-mine/community-mine">我的发布与请求恢复 →</navigator>
  <navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-feed/community-feed">返回校园社区 →</navigator>
</view>
